  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1269-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "On feature/ay2-herdr-transport-seam only (cipher): message threaded into HerdrError::ServerUnavailable/InternalError/Advisory variants and surfaced in recovery text; retry_after_ms threaded into ServerUnavailable.retry_after and consumed by breaker_retry_after()/record_infrastructure_failure_with_retry_after. Confirmed by req-qa (crates/atm-herdr/src/transport.rs:173-201, crates/atm-herdr/src/lib.rs:98-113,149-225,590-591); accompanying crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs change only touches atm-herdr's existing public surface (arch-qa, req-qa). Finding-level status stays fixed_partial pending merge-forward to feature/ay3-herdr-endpoint-doctor-config." .

